the number of vertices of the support all of whose neighbours lie in the \
support\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5ed714ef-1c9e-41d9-8a53-7e5ab40d2424"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"66927e20-7501-4587-af4d-\
1f7acd678950"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A region \[LongDash] a ball, shell, tube, cylinder or cone \[LongDash] has \
one member, its vertex set, and every vertex of the support has density 1. It \
has no ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Graph\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c632b51b-0484-4d2b-bd92-63e3059f5c54"],
 " and no ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Length\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60542e6a-c16a-4a69-9de9-e735d20c2223"],
 ". A sphere is a family, searched rather than read off a graph; its ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Faithful\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e6b583d2-9bda-45ce-b022-431c43b305fc"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Undetermined"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/Undetermined", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "67857bda-d336-44af-9765-27b4222e23d3"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2969f3fc-cda8-4e44-8752-2b1d0a3f62ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraIntersection"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraIntersection", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "995ec6a8-c67c-45d4-835e-f9f5e81301ec"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraUnion"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraUnion", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "49432fe1-38fc-4d33-a542-0c7628779022"],
 " are heads on heads: neither is a family of walks, so neither has a ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Graph\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1daa455f-1ff7-441c-b078-730511f277ff"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Cardinality\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73136573-d6be-47c1-b266-81b6f6efbc74"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Length\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "296f8672-5c1a-4c15-bf14-d95af34d67be"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<EdgeDensity\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c2d882de-871c-4e70-90a4-1d5e65c13d2b"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Faithful\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bfec79fd-33fa-4aaa-805e-c80c97b1e1d5"],
 ", and their ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "db564c1f-0f6d-4a0c-8e9a-830325b9bf1a"],
 " lists only the density, the subgraph and the two measures. The \
intersection's ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<VertexDensity\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b41f1ee0-c038-4f07-855b-5e0efbfe9955"],
 " is the product of the two objects' densities on their common vertices, the \
union's the sum."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2d54e7c7-edb5-4c62-9ab0-92007d6ef09d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A circle takes a radius ",
 Cell[BoxData["r"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "876dcac2-91f0-4d21-99aa-e6a920dc7006"],
 " or a band ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "s"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8664d52e-c017-4e2e-855f-95abc461ba48"],
 ", a scalar ",
 Cell[BoxData["r"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "370b2f40-0b3a-4ef1-a468-51f3a37c7734"],
 " meaning ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "r"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8c00948b-2ca2-4ea0-97ac-5ec76647aa0f"],
 ". The circle through a point is the closed arc ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraArc"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraArc", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["p", "TI"]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d0826030-9c52-458b-98ee-a680870b0f66"],
 ", which widens the band of ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<RadiusDelta\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
   RowBox[{"delta", " ", "|", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"deltaIn", ",", " ", "deltaOut"}], "}"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d4c36ea-d4ec-4749-acf4-f5eda789a8ed"],
 " (default ",
 Cell[BoxData["0"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1f2b925f-cd0e-4fa4-9df0-1ce3310d0f82"],
 "). A scalar ",
 StyleBox["delta", "TI"],
 " means ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "delta"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1fe6a2ac-9eb1-44cd-a723-95d42cecaa70"],
 ", outward only."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c2cf4cb0-c330-455b-accb-8c5d89e340f4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On a polyline ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraSegment"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSegment", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["p1", "TI"], ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]", ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["pk", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3d49f9ff-7c37-405f-887e-9e4a15d4a1c7"],
 " the densities are not member counts: they are the sums of the piece \
densities. On the 5 \[Times] 5 grid, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraSegment"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSegment", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "13", ",", " ", "25"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9f269283-a649-437d-9c48-98c03495eb93"],
 " has 36 members, while its density at the centre 13 is 12."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"05647835-3f96-4b5b-a03b-588b3947f820"]
}, Open  ]],

